    "structured_prompt": "{\n  \"short_description\": \"Two women race through a futuristic cyberpunk city during the day. One woman rides a sleek, glowing motorcycle on an elevated highway, while another follows closely behind on a levitating hoverboard. The city skyline is illuminated by bright sunlight with scattered neon lights still visible in the urban haze, creating a dynamic and high-speed atmosphere. The scene is filled with vibrant reds, whites, and golds, emphasizing the advanced technology and energetic pace of the urban environment.\",\n  \"objects\": [\n    {\n      \"description\": \"A woman with bright red hair, wearing a form-fitting black suit with red accent stripes, is intensely focused on riding a futuristic motorcycle. Her hair streams behind her, indicating speed.\",\n      \"location\": \"center-right foreground\",\n      \"relationship\": \"The primary subject, leading the race.\",\n      \"relative_size\": \"large within frame\",\n      \"shape_and_color\": \"Humanoid, black suit with red accents, red hair.\",\n      \"texture\": \"Smooth, possibly synthetic fabric for the suit; flowing hair.\",\n      \"appearance_details\": \"Determined expression, hair is vivid red and appears to be blowing in the wind.\",\n      \"pose\": \"Leaning forward over the handlebars, body angled for speed.\",\n      \"expression\": \"Serious, focused.\",\n      \"clothing\": \"Sleek, black, form-fitting full-body suit with red accent stripes along the arms, legs, and torso, possibly leather or a synthetic material.\",\n      \"action\": \"Riding a motorcycle at high speed.\",\n      \"gender\": \"Female\",\n      \"skin_tone_and_texture\": \"Fair skin, smooth texture.\",\n      \"orientation\": \"Facing forward and slightly to her right.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"description\": \"A futuristic motorcycle with glowing wheels, designed for high speed. Its body is dark and aerodynamic, with red and white lights emanating from the wheels and other accents.\",\n    