\": {\n    \"composition\": \"Dynamic diagonal composition with leading lines from the highway, emphasizing motion and depth. The main subjects are centered and slightly to the right, creating a sense of forward movement.\",\n    \"color_scheme\": \"High contrast, dominated by bright whites, sky blues, and warm golds with bold red accents on the characters and vehicles.\",\n    \"mood_atmosphere\": \"Energetic, futuristic, thrilling, bold, cyberpunk in daylight.\",\n    \"aesthetic_score\": \"very high\",\n    \"preference_score\": \"very high\"\n  },\n  \"photographic_characteristics\": {\n    \"depth_of_field\": \"Shallow, with the foreground subjects in sharp focus and the background city softly blurred to enhance speed.\",\n    \"focus\": \"Sharp focus on the motorcycle and its rider, with motion blur on the background city and the road to convey speed.\",\n    \"camera_angle\": \"Eye-level, slightly angled upwards to capture the height of the city and the elevated highway.\",\n    \"lens_focal_length\": \"Standard lens (e.g., 35mm-50mm) to capture both subjects and a good portion of the background.\"\n  },\n  \"style_medium\": \"Digital illustration\",\n  \"context\": \"This is a concept art piece for a cyberpunk-themed video game or a promotional image for a futuristic action movie, showcasing high-speed urban racing in a rare daytime setting.\",\n  \"artistic_style\": \"cyberpunk, neon, dynamic, daytime\"\n}",
